{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05","cat":"favorite","group":{"id":"fav5081","label":"Tove"},"label":"The Law of Survival","stage":null,"prev":"treasurestory_tove_04","next":"treasurestory_tove_06","speakers":{"tove":"Tove"},"icons":{"tove":"si_c192_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_1","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_1","text":"Per Maxwell's advice, Tove and I are on the surface in search of a replacement for the fire starter.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CityForest_03","bgArt":"cityforest_03","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_frostpillar","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_2","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_2","text":"We maneuver our way through a ruined city.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["tove"],"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_3","text":"It's all so simple when I think about it now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_4","text":"I found this one on the surface before,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_5","text":"so it'd stand to reason that I should search for a replacement in the same place.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_6","text":"Feels like I had to take a pretty long detour before figuring that out, though...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_7","text":"A circuitous path is a path all the same.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_8","text":"Hehe, I guess you're right. Whether you take the long or short route, you still end in the same spot.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_9","text":"I've found a way to fix my fire starter, and that's what matters.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_10","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_10","text":"Is there a specific reason you chose to start with this place?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_11","text":"I figured the odds of us finding something here would be highest.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_12","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_12","text":"What makes you think that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_13","text":"Take a look around you. This used to be a city.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_14","text":"Cities have infrastructure built to help people survive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_15","text":"The buildings here were designed to protect the inhabitants from external threats.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_16","text":"More supplies are accumulated in urban areas as well,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_17","text":"so it's relatively easy to find what you need.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_18","text":"Most people don't have the knowledge required to survive in harsh environments.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_19","text":"If disaster were to strike, they'd be most likely to try and stay in places they find familiar.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_20","text":"Ergo, when the First Rapture Invasion hit, and some couldn't make it to the Ark,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_21","text":"people most likely ran to cities like this in order to survive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_22","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_23","text":"... Sorry, did that get too heavy?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_24","text":"No, it's fine.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_25","text":"I must say,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_26","text":"you get awfully serious when you talk about survival.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_27","text":"Huh? Really?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_28","text":"I think I used to be a bit cavalier when it came to survival.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_29","text":"For the longest time, it was something I only saw on TV shows or read about in books.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_30","text":"But after working with everyone in the Unlimited Squad to rescue survivors at the northern base,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_31","text":"and going through all sorts of other disasters... my outlook changed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_32","text":"I started to realize that survival isn't some cool-sounding fantasy, it's reality.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_33","text":"Although to be honest, I still sometimes feel like I'm unqualified to talk about this stuff.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_34","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_34","text":"What do you mean? You're already an accomplished survival expert.","jump":"treasurestory_tove_05_36","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_35","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_35","text":"Don't worry. That'll change soon enough.","jump":"treasurestory_tove_05_38","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_36","text":"Heh, if that's what you think, maybe it really is true.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_37","text":"But I'm still convinced I've got a lot to learn from the other members of my squad.","jump":"treasurestory_tove_05_40","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_38","text":"Hehe, I certainly hope so.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_39","text":"After all, I'm surrounded by some incredible people in my squad.","jump":"treasurestory_tove_05_40","exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_40","text":"They truly are amazing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_41","text":"I really admire how they can handle missions in those extreme conditions at the northern base.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_42","text":"Whenever my tools actually help them out,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_43","text":"it gives me a real sense of pride.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"treasurestory_tove_05_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"tove","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:treasurestory_tove_05_44","text